OL,3,GNEWSAMan's death no longer considered
OL,4,Asuspicious
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe death of a 23-year-old man with "a
OL,7,Fheart of gold" is no longer being
OL,8,Ftreated as murder, police have said.
OL,10,FIson Alli from Penzance was found dead
OL,11,Fin a property in the Polruan Road area
OL,12,Fof Truro on 29 October 2025.
OL,14,FA 23-year-old man from Truro was
OL,15,Farrested on suspicion of murder at the
OL,16,Ftime before being released on police
OL,17,Fbail.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
