OL,3,GNEWSAMan's death no longer considered
OL,4,Asuspicious
OL,5,
OL,6,FDevon and Cornwall Police has now said
OL,7,Fthe death is no longer being treated as
OL,8,Fsuspicious and the man has been told
OL,9,Fthere will be no further police action
OL,10,Fagainst him.
